  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The power of your extra arm joints grants you extra leverage and strength in and out of combat. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li>Increase your Strength or Dexterity score by 1, up to a maximum of 20.</li><li>When you hit with an attack on your first turn in combat, the attack deals an extra 2d6 damage to it. You can use this ability only once per combat.</li><li>You count as one size larger when determining your carrying capacity and the weight you can push, drag, lift, and for grapple and shove attempts.</li></ul>",
